liborigin: notice for the Origin project reader of StokesForge
================================================================

The module `crates/stokesforge-import/src/origin/` (reader of the workbooks
of Origin .opj files) is a Rust port of a subset of liborigin 3.0.3, a C++
library for reading OriginLab project files:

    https://sourceforge.net/projects/liborigin/
    https://github.com/SciDAVis/liborigin

Ported from: OriginAnyParser.cpp (object framing, datasets, windows, layers,
curves) and OriginParser.cpp (grouping of columns into books and sheets).
No liborigin source file is shipped; only the knowledge of the file format
and the structure of these two parsers were ported, in new code.

